{
  "version": 1,
  "region": "europe-west3",
  "about": "Private coaching (DECISIONS D61): the shared client/server contract. functions/tests/test_coaching_contract.py and app/test/contracts/coaching_contract_test.dart read this file. Neither side changes it alone. Three server switches: COACH_PORTFOLIO_LIVE (applications, profiles, packages, drafts, certificates), COACH_CLIENTS_LIVE (requests, accepting, relationships, chat, plans, sessions, invites, ending) and COACH_PAYMENTS_LIVE (proofs, refunds, payouts, receipts, receiving accounts, ledger), matching coachPortfolioLive(), coachClientsLive() and coachPaymentsLive() in the rules. While payments are off, accepting a request starts the coaching at once with free: true.",
